{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>כדרך</b> Twice in the Masorah: כדרך כל הארץ · כדרך יום כה. In the case of the quail: just as here it refers to conjugal relations, so too there — and this is what the Sages said, that they lusted for forbidden relations in their request for the quail."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:16:28.524828076Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}